BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lost Mural Project’s Musical Memories Concert\, featuring Daniel
  Kahn
DTSTART:20260816T163000
DTEND:20260816T180000
DTSTAMP:20260817T012255Z
UID:fed6c5460544172e070c1f941adf81@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:An extraordinary troubadour\, songwriter\, translator\, and mu
 lti-instrumentalist\, Daniel Kahn’s music combines English\, Yiddish\, G
 erman and other languages in a radical mix of klezmer\, lyrical folk balla
 ds\, and dark cabaret. His projects and groups include the award-winning c
 ult band The Painted Bird\, as well as Brothers Nazaroff\, Semer Ensemble\
 , The Unternationale\, Bulat Blues\, The Disorientalists\, his duo with Ja
 ke Shulman-Ment\, “The Building & Other Songs\,” and a forthcoming tri
 o album with Shulman-Ment and Christian Dawid “Umru.”\n\nSources: Verm
 ont Public
LOCATION:Ohavi Zedek Synagogue\, 188 North Prospect St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/lost-mural
 -projects-musical-memories-concert-featuring-daniel-kahn-01-07-2026-13-49-
 49
END:VEVENT
