BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Falsettos
DTSTART:20260823T190000
DTEND:20260823T220000
DTSTAMP:20260817T012255Z
UID:8c37bc1cd8cddade9b97531473024a@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Hilarious\, heartbreaking\, and utterly unique\, Falsettos is 
 a contemporary musical set in the late 1970s\, exploring love and its cons
 equences. When Marvin leaves his wife and son to be with his lover\, their
  world is upended\, but amidst the chaos\, new bonds form and redefine wha
 t family can be. Falsettos is a tribute to the messy and beautiful connect
 ions that hold us together —through baseball games\, bar mitzvahs\, and 
 the unexpected twists of life\, requiring everyone to learn to grow up and
  face their future with love and dignity. This show will be running from 8
 /13-23 at Main Street Landing's Blackbox Theater with showtimes as follows
 : 7 PM: 8/13\, 14\, 15\, 20\, 21\, 22 1 PM: 8/15\, 16\, 22\, 23\n\nSources
 : Vermont Public
LOCATION:Main Street Landing Blackbox\, 60 Lake Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/falsettos-
 21-07-2026-14-18-35
END:VEVENT
